1
00:00:00,570 --> 00:00:02,370
(Leonard:)Oh, hi.

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:03,710
(Penny:)Hey, you.

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,210
(Penny:)What happened with
the contacts?

4
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,480
(Leonard:)One of them's upstairs.

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:10,050
(Leonard:)The other one sort of slipped
back into my skull.

6
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,400
(Penny:)Hey, is that one of the new
shirts Priya got you?

7
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,680
(Priya:)Yeah.

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,320
(Penny:)You don't wanna
wash that.

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,190
(Leonard:)No?
No, that's silk.

10
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,410
(Penny:)Seriously, what would you do
without me?

11
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:21,290
Yeah. (chuckles)

12
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,080
(Penny:)You know, I gotta
tell you, I think

13
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:27,660
(Penny:)you got a real winner
with Priya.
Yeah, me, too.

14
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,030
(Penny:)She seems really sweet.

15
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:31,200
(Penny:)Believe me, you do not want
to take that for granted.

16
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,970
(Penny:)There are a lot of bitches
out there.

17
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:38,370
(Leonard:)Yeah, bitches are the worst.

18
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,240
All right, I'll
see you later.

19
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,950
(Leonard:)Uh, Penny, there's something
I have to tell you.

20
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,080
(Penny:)What?

21
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,850
(Leonard:)Okay, uh, how do I put this?

22
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:51,520
(Leonard:)Um... are you familiar with
Darwin's observation

23
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:54,590
(Leonard:)of the finches
in the Galapagos Islands?

24
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:56,890
(Penny:)Did they make a movie about it?

25
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:58,590
(Priya:)No.

26
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,530
(Penny:)Then no.

